===Noun===
{{en-noun|es|-}}

# {{countable}} A type of grass of the [[genus]] ''[[Poa]]''.
# {{uncountable}} A style of [[country music]] with roots in Scots-Irish Appalachian folk music, [[blues]], and [[jazz]].  Characterized by [[banjo]]s, [[fiddle]]s, and [[mandolin]]s, but containing no drums.

